Problem
Set up password-less SSH authentication from thor user on jump host to all app servers through their respective sudo users.

Solution
bash
# On jump host as thor user
ssh-keygen -t rsa -b 2048

# Copy public key to each app server
ssh-copy-id tony@app1
ssh-copy-id tony@app2
ssh-copy-id steve@app3

# Test password-less access
ssh tony@app1
ssh tony@app2
ssh steve@app3
